  {
    "id": 1014001040010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ワン、ツー、スリー……\r\nここでターン！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0121",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040010"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あれ、ちょっと上手くいかなかったかも……\r\nよし、もう１回！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "se": "0121",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（甘奈、最近よく自主練をしているな……\r\n甜花といい、姉妹そろって……すごいな）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charCategory": "stand_jersey",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "014",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "se": "0118",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "x": -200,
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 700
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん、\r\n自主練に付き合ってくれて、ありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いやいや、プロデューサーならこれくらい当然だよ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ねぇ、今の甘奈どうだったかな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "上手くできていたよ\r\n最近は、さらに上達しているな！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、\r\nそれなら良かったー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……あ！\r\nねぇねぇプロデューサーさん、聞いて聞いて",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん？　なんだ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甜花ちゃんのことなんだけど、\r\n最近、めっちゃ頑張っててね",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "家に帰ってきたらすぐ寝ちゃうんだー",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そんなになるまでレッスンとか自主練とかして、\r\n本当にすごいよね！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "だから、甘奈ももっと頑張らなくちゃーって！",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……甘奈、\r\n本当に思っていることがあるなら、言っていいんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えっ……何もないよ？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺の前では無理しなくていいんだ\r\n何かあるなら、ちゃんと聞くから",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……えへへ\r\nプロデューサーさんに隠し事は、できないね……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あのね、甜花ちゃんがアイドルになって輝いたら、\r\nみんな甜花ちゃんのかわいさに気付いてくれるでしょ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それが甘奈の望みだったはずなんだー",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、オーディションのとき、そう言っていたな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それは今でも変わらないはずなのに……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ホントに甜花ちゃんが輝きはじめたら……\r\nなんか、怖くなってきちゃった……かも",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈から離れて、どっか行っちゃいそうって、\r\n考えちゃうんだ",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ねぇ、プロデューサーさん……どうしよう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040180"
  },
  {
    "select": "甜花は\r\n甘奈から離れない",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "甘奈も輝き始めている",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "ふたりの関係は\r\n変わっていく",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040190,
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう……かな？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、ふたりの絆は揺らがないよ\r\nそれを１番知っているのは、甘奈だろ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そうだけど、でも今は……",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040200"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈と甜花は今までずっと、他の誰よりも一緒にいたよな\r\nだからふたりには強い繋がりがある",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それはこれからも変わらない\r\nそうだろ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……うん……そうだった\r\n小さいころから、ずっと知ってたことだったよ",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040220,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "一緒の時間は減っちゃったけど、\r\nそれでも一緒のときは今までと変わってなかったし……",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040230,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ずっと、仲良いままだもん",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈と甜花は大丈夫だ\r\n心配なんてしなくていいんだぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040240,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、だよね！　よけいなこと考えないで\r\n甜花ちゃんと一緒に輝いていく！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、その意気だ！",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040250,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、プロデューサーさん、ありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040250"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040260,
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう、かな？\r\n甘奈ね、自分では分かんなくって……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことないさ\r\n俺には、ふたりとも輝いて見える",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040270,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈も、か……\r\nうん……そうなのかも……",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040270"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040280,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ステージの上に立つと楽しいって気持ちだけは\r\nずっと最初から変わってないんだ",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040280"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040290,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ファンのみんなが支えてくれてるんだって、\r\nうれしくなるんだ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040290"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、きっとそれが、甘奈を輝かせる原動力なんだな",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやってふたりとも輝いていけばいい\r\nそうすれば、怖くも寂しくもないはずだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040300,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、そうだね！\r\nこれからは、甘奈は甘奈で輝けるようにがんばるよ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040300"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040310,
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それは、怖い……かも",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040310"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……変わるけど、悪い方にはいかないさ\r\n甘奈が悪い方へ変えないようにすればいいだろ？",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040320,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "でも、甜花ちゃんは輝こうとしているのに、\r\n甘奈が足を引っ張っちゃったら……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だったら、甜花に負けないくらい甘奈も輝けばいい",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040330,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "それって……どういう……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040330"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘奈が、甜花のライバルになるってことだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040340,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ライバル？\r\nこんなに仲良しなのに？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040340"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、ふたりの仲の良さはそのままでだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040350,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "仲良しなのに、ライバル……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040350"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040360,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そしたら、甜花ちゃんと一緒に……\r\nううん、これからはもっと……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040360"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040370,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "えへ、なんかいいかも！\r\nサイコーに楽しくなりそー",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040370"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "楽しいだけじゃないさ\r\nふたりとも今よりも、もっといい関係になるはずだ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040380,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ホント？\r\n甘奈、本気にしちゃうよ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040380"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ、俺を信じていいぞ",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014001040390,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "うん、信じちゃう！　これからめっちゃすごくて\r\nめっちゃかわいー双子アイドルになれるよう、がんばるね☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "nextLabel": "end",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400104/1014001040390"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]